{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"f4e560f467460fae","x":-480,"y":-133,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"### Enumeration"},
		{"id":"a5a3648a11368bc3","x":-137,"y":-160,"width":528,"height":115,"type":"text","text":"Enumeration ek active information gathering process hai jisme attacker ya security tester target system se authenticated ya detailed information collect karta hai, jaise users, groups, shares, services, operating system, domain details aur network resources."},
		{"id":"ed05ac03bba18a8c","x":-42,"y":-280,"width":338,"height":86,"type":"text","text":">Scanning ke baad target se detailed information nikalna = Enumeration"},
		{"id":"18f5977f1fd74cd4","x":42,"y":-380,"width":171,"height":50,"type":"text","text":"Why Enumeration?"},
		{"id":"7203f7d83c2a45e7","x":-1,"y":-1060,"width":258,"height":620,"type":"text","text":"Suppose scan me mila:\n\n```\n22/tcp  Open  SSH\n\n80/tcp  Open  HTTP\n\n445/tcp Open  SMB\n```\n\nAb sirf ports pata hain.\n\nEnumeration me pata chalega:\n\n```\nUsers\n\nShared folders\n\nDomain\n\nOperating System\n\nSoftware Version\n\nPermissions\n```"},
		{"id":"0c2425a5ff5821e9","x":594,"y":-133,"width":194,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"Types of enumeration"},
		{"id":"b897086a748c4ce6","x":1100,"y":-384,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"User Enumeration"},
		{"id":"bb5d3c3987ebbbb2","type":"text","text":"Group Enumeration","x":1100,"y":-300,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"ade0e1422c3522e4","type":"text","text":"Share Enumeration","x":1100,"y":-220,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"d1bbbd05e5392e89","x":1100,"y":-133,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"LDAP Enumeration"},
		{"id":"fe7a92a69945dc6d","type":"text","text":"Service Enumeration","x":1100,"y":-40,"width":250,"height":60},
		{"id":"996d1faa3362dfbf","x":1100,"y":40,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"DNS Enumeration"},
		{"id":"f400725ad5ba24e1","x":1100,"y":120,"width":250,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"SNMP Enumeration"},
		{"id":"18db69a461eccab4","x":2040,"y":-280,"width":94,"height":175,"type":"text","text":"C$\n\nADMIN$\n\nPublic\n\nShared"},
		{"id":"b4fb1d647db6e455","x":1774,"y":-332,"width":202,"height":125,"type":"text","text":"Administrators\n\nRemote Desktop Users\n\nBackup Operators"},
		{"id":"8112c9ce764d5ed7","x":1789,"y":-529,"width":131,"height":175,"type":"text","text":"Administrator\n\nGuest\n\nJohn\n\nAdmin"},
		{"id":"4c6e839c5233bf15","x":1798,"y":-185,"width":113,"height":175,"type":"text","text":"Users\n\nGroups\n\nComputers\n\nPolicies"},
		{"id":"131916926d5f5a95","x":1976,"y":-97,"width":76,"height":175,"type":"text","text":"SSH\n\nFTP\n\nHTTP\n\nSMTP"},
		{"id":"e3721e2863ace7ce","x":1814,"y":20,"width":123,"height":175,"type":"text","text":"Hostname\n\nSubdomains\n\nMX Records\n\nNS Records"},
		{"id":"a666f8300a8cf03f","x":1831,"y":240,"width":161,"height":175,"type":"text","text":"Hostname\n\nNetwork Devices\n\nRunning Services\n\nInterfaces"},
		{"id":"1079f980f34449df","x":2460,"y":-320,"width":288,"height":255,"type":"text","text":"| Protocol | Information           |\n| -------- | --------------------- |\n| SMB      | Users, Shares         |\n| SNMP     | Network Information   |\n| DNS      | Hostnames, Records    |\n| LDAP     | Active Directory Data |\n| SMTP     | Email Users           |\n| FTP      | Files and Permissions |\n| NFS      | Shared Directories    |\n"},
		{"id":"68acbf7e0cecd070","x":2840,"y":-320,"width":707,"height":115,"type":"text","text":"Enumeration is an active information gathering process performed after scanning. It involves connecting to network services and collecting detailed information such as users, groups, shared resources, operating system details, services, and domain information. This information helps understand the target environment during a security assessment."},
		{"id":"a63cc7b591919d12","x":551,"y":660,"width":281,"height":60,"type":"text","text":"#### Service and port Enumerate"},
		{"id":"8698432b54e47781","x":1080,"y":411,"width":498,"height":558,"type":"text","text":"| Port      | Protocol       | Kaam                            |\n| --------- | -------------- | ------------------------------- |\n| 53        | DNS            | Name resolution / Zone Transfer |\n| 135       | RPC            | Windows remote services         |\n| 137       | NBNS           | Computer name lookup            |\n| 139       | NetBIOS        | Old SMB sharing                 |\n| 445       | SMB            | Windows file sharing            |\n| 161       | SNMP           | Device monitoring               |\n| 162       | SNMP Trap      | Alerts                          |\n| 389       | LDAP           | Directory authentication        |\n| 2049      | NFS            | Linux file sharing              |\n| 25        | SMTP           | Email sending                   |\n| 500       | IKE            | VPN tunnel                      |\n| 22        | SSH/SFTP       | Secure remote login             |\n| 3268      | Global Catalog | AD search                       |\n| 5060/5061 | SIP            | VoIP calls                      |\n| 20/21     | FTP            | File transfer                   |\n| 23        | Telnet         | Old remote login                |\n| 69        | TFTP           | Simple file transfer            |\n| 179       | BGP            | Internet routing                |\n"}
	],
